  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling the Philippines to prepare its Second Biennial Transparency Report with a combined Third National Communication (BTR2/NC3) and Third Biennial Transparency Report (BTR3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the amount of the past and current activities on climate change in the country, the present proposal will extensively draw from and build upon the past and current work rather than duplicating what has been and is being undertaken. Thus, the main objective of this proposal is to support the Philippines prepare and submit the Second Biennial Transparency Report and a combined Third National Communication and Third Biennial Transparency Report (BTR2/NC3 + BTR3) in compliance with the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC) and Paris Agreement&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s (PA) reporting obligations.</narrative>
  </description>
